line"><span>&nbsp;</span>[draft-mglt-lurk-tls12]<span>&nbsp;should
 be mentioned&nbsp;</span></span>similarly to KEYLESS as it addresses the s=
ecurity concerns of KEYLESS.&nbsp;<br>
</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0px"><br>
</div>
