<div style=3D"margin:0px"><br>
</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0px">Internet-Draft &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Delegat=
ed Credentials for TLS &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;June 2020<b=
r>
</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0px"><br>
</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0px"><br>
</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0px">&nbsp; &nbsp;algorithms supported for TLS authent=
ication to those the CA is<br>
</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0px">&nbsp; &nbsp;willing to issue a certificate for.&=
nbsp; Nonetheless, existing automated<br>
